  "notes": "USAGE:\nA godan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}) ending in -ru. Not to be confused with the ichidan verb {閉|し}める (to close) or {締|し}める (to tighten). Often used in the ～ている form to describe a current damp state.\n\nThe transitive counterpart is {湿|しめ}らせる (to dampen, to moisten).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {空気|くうき}が{湿|しめ}る: the air gets humid\n- {布団|ふとん}が{湿|しめ}る: the futon gets damp\n- {湿|しめ}った{空気|くうき}: damp air\n- {湿|しめ}った{土|つち}: moist soil",
